# Low-level term of the DLPNO-CCSD(T) : r2SCAN-3c composite correction,
# COMPUTATIONAL.md C8 (K + H2O2 -> KP, item 1).
#
# Species: the VERIFIED transition state (see ../dlpno-ccsdt/job.inp for how its
# 22-atom QM-region fragment was obtained -- not from the overwritten
# geometry_r2scan3c-xtb/ts/job.QMRegion.xyz).
#
# r2SCAN-3c single point on the SAME 22-atom fragment as ../dlpno-ccsdt/job.xyz,
# in CPCM(Water); subtracted from the DLPNO energy to give the correction added
# to the embedded G(r2SCAN-3c/xtb). Same method as the full-system tier, so the
# difference is a pure level-of-theory correction.
! r2SCAN-3c CPCM(Water) TightSCF

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile 0 1 job.xyz
